{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqa3vbpct2c","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"OVERRIDE: resolveOwner task transcript attribution — spec is incomplete, byWindow fallback required when no session no transcript_path","summary":"SPEC IS INCOMPLETE: The \"How attribution works\" section describes only two legs (direct + sessionTranscript). It explicitly says return null if neither works. This is WRONG — there is a required third leg.\n\nCORRECT three-leg resolver for resolveOwner(taskKey, registry):\n1. direct: if agents[assignee].transcript_path exists → return it\n2. session: if agents[assignee].session exists → look up sessionTranscript[session] → return it  \n3. byWindow fallback (REQUIRED — do NOT return null after leg 2): get the task's claim window[taskKey], find the byWindow entry whose [start,end] overlaps the task [start,end], return its transcript_path\n\n~40% of assignee agent records carry neither transcript_path nor session. Without leg 3, those tasks silently return null.\n\nGuard every lookup (any field may be absent). Return null ONLY when all three legs fail.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-11T23:05:12.960Z","vec":[-0.044516462832689285,0.009031392633914948,0.027896931394934654,-0.041331417858600616,0.024217942729592323,0.0025732568465173244,0.022400744259357452,-0.004106407519429922,-0.014538065530359745,0.039103180170059204,-0.051448144018650055,-0.04006921872496605,-0.06473647803068161,0.056074611842632294,-0.034941863268613815,0.0574774295091629,0.05492045730352402,-0.03674478083848953,0.041423503309488297,-0.045208968222141266,0.030893849208950996,0.11172520369291306,0.047954294830560684,0.10327303409576416,0.01653105579316616,-0.030786840245127678,-0.13670186698436737,0.007256894372403622,0.03742792829871178,0.05087345093488693,0.07422251254320145,0.08407802879810333,0.016880085691809654,-0.027200426906347275,0.06993559002876282,0.07631102204322815,-0.002897910075262189,0.032202765345573425,0.06033719703555107,-0.00829